@startuml brand-onboarding-state
title Brand Profile Onboarding | State Machine
hide empty description
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
skinparam monochrome true
skinparam backgroundColor white
top to bottom direction
skinparam roundcorner 12
skinparam state {
  BackgroundColor white
  BorderColor #333333
}
skinparam noteBackgroundColor white
skinparam ranksep 40

state PENDING
state COMPLETED

[*] --> PENDING : / initialize onboardingStatus
PENDING --> COMPLETED : complete(auth, revision)\n[Brand owner with UPDATE_BRAND_PROFILE, current If-Match,\nand required profile fields present (BR-08)]\n/ set onboardingCompletedAt and increment profileRevision
COMPLETED --> [*]

note right of COMPLETED
  Onboarding has ended. The profile remains editable.
  Updates to the profile must still satisfy BR-08.
  Calling complete again with valid data and the current
  ETag leaves the status and revision unchanged.
end note
@enduml
